Subject: [PATCH 21/37] refactor: rewire backtesting/backtest.py onto
 broker.factory.get_gateway

Same treatment as main.py: no more direct MetaTrader5 import, async
run_backtest() using 'async with gateway:'. Uses the simulation broker
by default, so backtesting/backtest.py is now runnable without a
Windows MT5 terminal or the tests/conftest.py MT5 stub at all.

Tests updated for the async, gateway-based flow.
